                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "232e5b2c-578f-3dcc-b8c7-eefb52630ffc",
                        "entry_id": "a8238620-8e74-31e5-965b-1e7677d043dd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To enforce incorrectly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0c63271-5e20-4bcd-bbd7-192d6a005339",
                                "sense_id": "232e5b2c-578f-3dcc-b8c7-eefb52630ffc",
                                "text": "But exactly in proportion to his lofty estimate of law, when thus enforced and applied, he is indignant and jealous at any attempt to wrest or misenforce it:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9418dc3f-68e7-414b-a38c-56aed42bd1ec",
                                "sense_id": "232e5b2c-578f-3dcc-b8c7-eefb52630ffc",
                                "text": "Few legislators dare run for office on a platform proposing a solution; they know they would be powerless to accomplish anything if elected; someone else would misenforce the law."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7f228a3-c0c1-4978-affc-d6d8ff27db2b",
                                "sense_id": "232e5b2c-578f-3dcc-b8c7-eefb52630ffc",
                                "text": "If they see something I missed, or if I misenforce a penalty or become confused, I encourage them to question me or point out my mistake."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfc17763-0ced-4c0c-9396-bf16886e14da",
                                "sense_id": "232e5b2c-578f-3dcc-b8c7-eefb52630ffc",
                                "text": "This “victim” of the public fool [I mean school] system is legally and socially illiterate and makes a good “sheep” who is easy for the District Attorney (D.A.) to boss around and who will ignorantly misenforce the tax code so that he will maximize the government's take from the institutionalized plunder and theft called the income tax."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
